        <p>For general inquiries, support, or feedback:</p>
        <p><a href="mailto:fleetguideprivacy@gmail.com">fleetguideprivacy@gmail.com</a></p>
        <p style="font-size: 0.9rem; color: #999; margin-top: 1rem;">
