        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="faq-section">
      <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <h3>How can I contact FleetGuide.in?</h3>
        <p>
          You can reach us via email at fleetguideprivacy@gmail.com. We respond to all inquiries within 24-48 hours. For specific concerns like business inquiries or technical support, please use the dedicated email addresses listed above.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <h3>Are your calculators really free to use?</h3>
        <p>
          Yes! All our calculators and tools are completely free to use. There are no hidden fees, subscriptions, or registration requirements. We believe in providing accessible fleet management tools to everyone.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <h3>How do I report incorrect information?</h3>
        <p>
          If you find any inaccurate information on our website, please email us at fleetguideprivacy@gmail.com with details about the issue. We take accuracy seriously and will investigate and correct any errors promptly.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <h3>Can I suggest new features or calculators?</h3>
        <p>
          Absolutely! We welcome suggestions from our users. Email your ideas to fleetguideprivacy@gmail.com. We regularly review user feedback and implement the most requested features.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <h3>Do you offer consulting services?</h3>
        <p>
          Currently, FleetGuide.in focuses on providing free tools and educational content. For consulting inquiries, please contact business@fleetguide.in and we can discuss potential partnerships or referrals.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <h3>How do I advertise on FleetGuide.in?</h3>
        <p>
          For advertising and sponsorship opportunities, please email business@fleetguide.in with details about your requirements. We offer various advertising options tailored to the transport and fleet management industry.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <h3>Can I contribute articles or content?</h3>
        <p>
          We're always interested in quality content from industry experts. If you'd like to contribute articles, guides, or reviews, please email us at contact@fleetguide.in with your proposal and writing samples.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <h3>How do you ensure privacy of user data?</h3>
        <p>
          We take user privacy seriously. Our calculators don't store your input data, and we don't collect personal information without consent. For complete details, please review our <a href="/privacy-policy" style="color: var(--primary); text-decoration: underline;">Privacy Policy</a>.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <h3>Do you have a mobile app?</h3>
        <p>
          Currently, FleetGuide.in is a web-based platform optimized for all devices including smartphones and tablets. A dedicated mobile app may be developed in the future based on user demand.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <h3>How often is content updated?</h3>
        <p>
          We regularly update our content to reflect the latest transport regulations, technology developments, and industry best practices. Transport rules and regulations are reviewed quarterly, while articles and guides are updated as needed.
        </p>
      </div>
